{"id":"vod_bf_41112","vodId":"41112","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"亚尔斯兰战记 风尘乱舞","name_cn":"亚尔斯兰战记 风尘乱舞","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-42/b7ca91566a30cb16bfbe0a02303929a7.jpg"},"summary":"帕尔斯是一个富饶而又强大的国家，百姓们在此安居乐业，国泰民安。然而，异教徒之国鲁西达尼亚的铁蹄踏破了帕尔斯的宁静，纷飞的战火烧毁了辛苦维系的和平。帕尔斯在战场之上节节败退，丢掉了大片的疆土，国家走到了灭亡的边缘，王子亚尔斯兰（小林裕介 配音）亦不得不踏上逃亡的旅途，一路上保护着他的，是忠诚而又强壮的骑士达龙（细谷佳正 配音），两人相互扶持，是否能够完成复国的愿景呢？　　那尔撒斯（浪川大辅 配音）、耶拉姆（花江夏树 配音）、奇夫（大桥贤一郎 配音），一路上，亚尔斯兰结识了一群愿意跟着他出生入死的好友，他们相互信赖，相互依靠，彼此之间结下了深厚的友谊。在重重的困难之中，一行人艰难的向着王都进发。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:00:58","playable":true,"episodeCount":8,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanjifengchenluanwu/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanjifengchenluanwu/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanjifengchenluanwu/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanjifengchenluanwu/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanjifengchenluanwu/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanjifengchenluanwu/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanjifengchenluanwu/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanjifengchenluanwu/第08集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32:47.888Z"}